  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance Mechanisms for Protection in Guatemala</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to provide integral protection services for people in need of international protection (PNIP) in Guatemala, promoting access to specialized protection services for the full enjoyment of their rights and the capacity to exercise them, while strengthening the capacities of key local actors as duty bearers.</narrative>
  </description>
